      "id": 1,
      "text": "After the 1848 Treaty of Guadalupe Hidalgo, Sandia Knolls became part of the United States, inviting Anglo-American settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
